    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0641" n="535" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg535"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lincoln to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June 10, 1891</hi>.</date>
                        (Received June 19.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 472.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch numbered 470, of
                    the 6th instant, I have the honor to inclose herewith the report of a short
                    debate which took place in the House of Lords on the 8th instant, when the
                    Behring Sea bill was passed, after having been slightly amended on the Marquis
                    of Salisbury’s motion.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert T.
                    Lincoln</hi>.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d470-a1.xml" xpointer="d470-a1"/>
            </div>
